49
00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:33.920
Saama.

50
00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.220
Ei lase.

51
00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.575
Et astuge ligi ja veenduge ise.

52
00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:05.489
Kuidas sa niisuguse asja peale ei
