105
00:11:47.679 --> 00:11:52.660
Milleks mannat raputada? Kas sulle
siis maitseb lõunaks mannapuder?

106
00:11:52.809 --> 00:11:54.180
Ei maitse, ei?

107
00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.820
Maitse,
ma pean mannaputru alati hommikuti

108
00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:59.730
