137
00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.170
Teeme moosipirukaid, trip.

138
00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:16.690
Kes siis enne lõunasööki sööb moosi,
piruka?

139
00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:21.150
Kui siis juba lihapirukaid

140
00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:26.230
Teeme siis lihapirukaid, need on
ka head. Teeme lihapirukaid,

141
00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.140
