156
00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.375
Sinise, selge, ma valin kohe välja.

157
00:18:17.369 --> 00:18:19.919
No Eva, vali siis ise.

158
00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.780
Tema on natukene sekinud,
