177
00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:36.940
Rosinaid suhkruga.

178
00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:40.360
Ega ma pärast seda ei imestada ka,
et kuhu mu rosinad köögikapist

179
00:23:40.460 --> 00:23:42.060
